# Static allowlist - always whitelisted regardless of knocks.
# One or more entries per line (space or comma separated); '#' starts a comment.
# Entries may be IPv4/IPv6 addresses, CIDRs, or hostnames (re-resolved every STATIC_REFRESH seconds).
# The file is re-read automatically when it changes - no restart needed.

